# Proof of the Tolev 2009 entry

`LeanLab/Tolev2009/Decomp83.lean` proves `published_assembly`, the main Theorem of D. I. Tolev,
The ternary Goldbach problem with primes from arithmetic progressions, arXiv 0902.2669,
display 5 on page 2, with the singular series printed by Halupczok 2008.
`LeanLab/Tolev2009/FinishAssembly1112.lean` proves the same statement by a second route,
`published_assembly_finished`. Binary Goldbach is open and is not claimed. AI agents wrote the
Lean code and it reuses ported and earlier lab code, see `PORTING.md`; it was checked by the
Lean kernel.
